Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So while I was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,walking to the bedroom
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.44,0:00:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,the happily booted up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.82,0:00:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,again and talked to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The next morning woke
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,up Over 800 messages
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.52,0:00:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I panicked I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,pulled the I read
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,every single message
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,just to see if
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the leaked my private
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.24,0:00:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,life Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,happened But it could
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.99,0:00:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,have But there was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.99,0:00:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the where it went
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.06,0:00:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,viral Today the project
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,is called OpenClaw It's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.14,0:00:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,pretty much the growing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,open source project
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Its mascot is a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,claws into your machine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Chenxin Huang calls it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the operating system for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,personal AI But
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.58,0:00:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,by far my favorite
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,quote is from a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:00:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,who looked at this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:00:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,statistic and said Peter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.58,0:00:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,this is not hockey
